<p><a href="v2.php?view=reports&amp;report=activations">Se indsamlet aktiveringsstatus, datoer og licensmetadata</a></p>
<p>Registrér købte rettigheder og tildelinger. Installeret software og Windows-aktivering dokumenterer ikke licensret. Produktmatch bruger normaliseret programnavn og valgfrit producentfelt, aldrig en automatisk juridisk licensvurdering. Brugerlicenser kan ikke udledes af enhedens softwareliste.</p>
<details class="panel"><summary>Registrér produkt</summary><form method="post" action="v2-action.php"><?php postFields('product');?><label>Kunde<select name="customer_id" required><option value="">Vælg kunde</option><?php foreach($customers as $c):?><option value="<?=h($c['id'])?>"><?=h($c['name'])?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><?php formInput('name','Programnavn som i inventaret','text','',true);formInput('publisher','Producent (tom = alle producenter)');?><button type="submit">Opret produkt</button></form></details>
<details class="panel"><summary>Registrér køb eller abonnement</summary><form method="post" action="v2-action.php"><?php postFields('entitlement');?><label>Produkt<select name="product_id" required><option value="">Vælg produkt</option><?php foreach($products as $p):?><option value="<?=h($p['id'])?>"><?=h(($customerNames[(int)$p['customer_id']]??$p['customer_id']).' · '.$p['name'])?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><?php metricSelect();formInput('seats','Antal pladser','number',1,true);formInput('reference','Indkøbs-/abonnementsreference');formInput('starts_on','Startdato','date');formInput('expires_on','Udløbsdato (tom = ingen registreret udløbsdato)','date');?><button type="submit">Registrér licensret</button></form></details>
<section class="panel"><h2>Produkter og registrerede installationer</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Kunde</th><th>Produkt</th><th>Producentmatch</th><th>Observerede enheder</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($products as $p):?><tr><td><?=h($customerNames[(int)$p['customer_id']]??$p['customer_id'])?></td><td><?=h($p['name'])?></td><td><?=h($p['publisher']?:'Alle')?></td><td><?=h($p['installed_devices'])?></td></tr><?php endforeach ?></tbody></table></div><p>Senest kendte softwareinventar, ikke samtidig anvendelse eller licensforbrug. Antallet omfatter matchende registrerede computerinventarer og kan være forældet.</p><?php if($productsLimited):?><p>Kun de første 500 produkter vises.</p><?php endif ?></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Licensbeholdning</h2><form method="get" class="list-controls"><input type="hidden" name="view" value="licenses"><label>Søg produkt eller reference<input name="q" value="<?=h($f['q'])?>" maxlength="250"></label><label>Kunde<select name="customer"><option value="">Alle tilgængelige</option><?php foreach($customers as $c):?><option value="<?=h($c['id'])?>" <?=(string)$c['id']===$f['customer']?'selected':''?>><?=h($c['name'])?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><button type="submit">Filtrér beholdning</button></form>
<?php foreach($entitlements as $e):?><details class="change-item"><summary><?=h($e['name'])?> · <?=h($e['seats'])?> <?=((int)$e['seats'])===1?'plads':'pladser'?> · pr. <?=$e['metric']==='device'?'enhed':'bruger'?> · <?=h($e['assigned'])?> tildelt <?=((int)$e['archived'])?'· Arkiveret':''?></summary><p><?=h($customerNames[(int)$e['customer_id']]??$e['customer_id'])?> · reference <?=h($e['reference'])?> · fra <?=h($e['starts_on']??'ikke angivet')?> til <?=h($e['expires_on']??'ingen udløbsdato')?></p>
<?php if(!(int)$e['archived']):?><details><summary>Redigér licensret</summary><form method="post" action="v2-action.php"><?php postFields('edit-entitlement',(int)$e['id']);metricSelect($e['metric']);formInput('seats','Pladser','number',$e['seats'],true);formInput('reference','Reference','text',$e['reference']);formInput('starts_on','Start','date',$e['starts_on']);formInput('expires_on','Udløb','date',$e['expires_on']);?><button type="submit">Gem licensret</button></form></details>
<details><summary>Tildel licens</summary><form method="post" action="v2-action.php"><?php postFields('assign',(int)$e['id']);if($e['metric']==='device'):?><label>Computer hos licenskunden<select name="agent_id" required><option value="">Vælg computer</option><?php foreach($devices as $device):if((int)$device['customer_id']!==(int)$e['customer_id'])continue;?><option value="<?=h($device['agent_id'])?>"><?=h($device['hostname'])?></option><?php endforeach ?></select></label><?php else:formInput('subject','Brugerreference (fx intern identitet)','text','',true);endif ?><button type="submit">Tildel</button></form></details><form method="post" action="v2-action.php"><?php postFields('archive',(int)$e['id']);?><label><input type="checkbox" required>Jeg vil arkivere licensretten og frigive dens tildelinger.</label><button type="submit">Arkivér licensret</button></form><?php endif ?></details><?php endforeach ?><?php if(!$entitlements):?><p>Ingen registrerede licensrettigheder matcher.</p><?php endif ?><?php if($entitlementsLimited):?><p>Kun 500 licensrettigheder vises; indsnævr filtrene eller brug eksport.</p><?php endif ?></section>
<section class="panel"><h2>Aktive tildelinger</h2><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th>Produkt</th><th>Type</th><th>Enhed/brugerreference</th><th>Handling</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($assignments as $assignment):?><tr><td><?=h($assignment['name'])?></td><td><?=h(v2Label($assignment['metric']))?></td><td><?=h($assignment['subject'])?></td><td><form method="post" action="v2-action.php"><?php postFields('release',(int)$assignment['id']);?><button type="submit">Frigiv</button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach ?></tbody></table></div><?php if($assignmentsLimited):?><p>Kun de første 500 aktive tildelinger vises.</p><?php endif ?></section>
